fin-risk:BucketDefinitionShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "A Bucket Definition, is an interpretable definition of one bucket within a RiskBucketSchema, used to make a bucket key a typed object rather than an opaque string, so that key alignment, missing-bucket handling, and cross-granularity comparison between a measurement and a limit are unambiguous.";
