fin-risk:RiskBucketSetShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "A Risk Bucket Set, is a versioned closure over the RiskBucketValue versions selected by this set version at a specified as-of and generating context that belong to one exact RiskBucketSchema version, used to prove a bucketed result is closed by means of an ordered-set digest and a successful completeness probe. A bucketSetPurpose attribute distinguishes a measurement-side result set from a limit-side schedule, so the same structure is not silently reused as both a value and a threshold. The closure-evidence requirements (bucketValueCount, bucketValueSetDigest, closureProbeRef/Digest, closureCompleted) are mandatory only when the ValidatedReproducibleRiskMeasurement profile is active; a preliminary bucket set may carry its members without a completed closure proof. Membership is frozen at the set version's as-of/context, not a context-free notion of \"current\".";
    sh:name "Risk Bucket Set";
    sh:property <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/attribute/0d8aae1709b2cef949269f6c>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/attribute/4518599ae0fb31836d041d87>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/attribute/575cbbbb3b7ed5c1bc736dc3>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/attribute/5bc05d866f3b0ead1ab74e8b>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/attribute/895b5c365d617220e898d63d>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/attribute/b017f8be83e789538f8765bc>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/attribute/bb644c63a485f9de5f5db904>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/immutable-version/1546f4be8593f8b2da423607>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/immutable-version/af9bccfcc999a1901c9cfbc3>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/imported-attribute/9b634b38293544ecdb3cffe9>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/provenance/910a4941731155c4c7cafbfe>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/provenance/f31743343a8f991854642cfe>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/temporal/03727e96cec2b79c1d8f9f29>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/temporal/af6029d9b458f2ce4f75cff7>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/temporal/f05c2d086ac5a605305520ea>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskBucketSet/shape/temporal/f0f2f601393d100a35dc2429>;
