    sh:description "A Risk Dimension, is an interpretable dimension along which a bucketed risk result is sliced, used to upgrade a free-text bucketKey and a bare bucketDimensionRef into a typed, queryable object so that bucket alignment and comparison across measurements and limits are well-defined.";
