fin-risk:RiskLimitBreachCaseShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "A Risk Limit Breach Case, is the governance case opened for a LimitBreach — carrying breach magnitude, duration, responsible party, and a workflow status — used to separate the immutable computational breach fact from its governance disposition, so that a breach has a case, acknowledgements, waivers, remediation, and escalations rather than a single fact.";
