fin-risk:RiskLimitEvaluationShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "A Risk Limit Evaluation, is an explicit deterministic conclusion for one exact RiskMeasurement version and one compatible exact RiskLimit version that represents withinLimit, breach, or indeterminate as a required code value rather than as an absence, used to make the outcome of comparing a measurement with its limit unambiguous and non-empty. Scope compatibility is defined by an explicit scopeMatchRule (exactMatch / approvedRollup / contains) rather than a vague \"same scope\", and a comparison policy role governs bucket-vs-bucket comparison. For the bucket branch the result is determined per the RiskLimitComparisonPolicy (per-bucket and/or aggregate, with key alignment, missing-bucket handling, tolerance, rounding, and unit/currency conversion) rather than a scalar value<=threshold. evaluatorDigest is mandatory only when the ValidatedReproducibleRiskMeasurement profile is active.";
    sh:name "Risk Limit Evaluation";
    sh:property <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/attribute/062d0ff2dfcbcf9f4769a050>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/attribute/6960e39916e0ca55320c92b1>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/attribute/d8832350e2f5a95be0e491b9>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/attribute/ff05bb7b5e83ef9ff1597b81>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/immutable-version/1546f4be8593f8b2da423607>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/immutable-version/af9bccfcc999a1901c9cfbc3>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/imported-attribute/9b634b38293544ecdb3cffe9>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/participant-role-evaluatedLimit/9f8adebde56cd85df065a984>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/participant-role-evaluatedMeasurement/091eb48b0e172395e7cbcc9e>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/participant-role-evaluationComparisonPolicy/18fb29c06200837bba31e63e>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/provenance/910a4941731155c4c7cafbfe>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/provenance/f31743343a8f991854642cfe>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/temporal/03727e96cec2b79c1d8f9f29>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/temporal/af6029d9b458f2ce4f75cff7>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/temporal/f05c2d086ac5a605305520ea>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskLimitEvaluation/shape/temporal/f0f2f601393d100a35dc2429>;
