fin-risk:RiskMeasureDefinitionShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "A Risk Measure Definition, is the retained compatibility binding of a RiskMeasureSpecification to a CalculationProfile and an ImplementationVersion that fixes the calculation method, parameterization, input and output contracts, and exactly one Money, Quantity, or bucket-schema result dimension independently of any computed result, used to bind a risk metric to a stable, reproducible recipe. Its IRI is retained for compatibility; the audit-grade digest/contract requirements (methodDigest, implementationDigest, inputContractDigest, outputContractDigest, source-artifact evidence) are mandatory only when the ValidatedReproducibleRiskMeasurement profile is active and are otherwise optional evidence, so that preliminary and data-quality-limited definitions remain expressible. New definitions should anchor business semantics on RiskMeasureSpecification and computation on CalculationProfile/ImplementationVersion.";
    sh:name "Risk Measure Definition";
    sh:property <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/0e1657ccb4eb53f55ef766aa>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/0fd26f58ebd2c88a428eefa1>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/11e8634eec7599f4efbaf32e>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/3e9036dd02fa598d494e5158>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/3f8157d6865f6cb36a75b910>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/438c16de0ce00b32ffa65c4e>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/6b875553f3fd22f126ba0437>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/80933c09d062233a075c23c9>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/90a3ffd7b0dfd22c49e1b1d0>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/9b6eab3abe35e817cf37a6c0>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/b2b8b139af9f037a0da7f36e>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/b61f1a6d149735499908a58c>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/d9a7be64c89cd040ce29d2b9>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/e7a5f4ef319528d111b59088>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/f0a62320f332e6336abba255>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/attribute/f38b8c668e02c86e5422bba5>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/immutable-version/1546f4be8593f8b2da423607>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/risk/RiskMeasureDefinition/shape/immutable-version/af9bccfcc999a1901c9cfbc3>, <https://axiolune.ai/ont