    sh:description "A Risk Report, is a report view over risk results — report as-of, audience, and sections — used to express the aggregation and reporting dimension that BCBS 239 emphasizes, distinct from the underlying computed results. Full BCBS 239 aggregation infrastructure is out of scope; this is a lightweight report-view hook.";
