    sh:description "A Scenario Shock, is a typed shock applied to a shock target within a stress scenario, used to decompress the opaque shockParameterDigest into queryable shock parameters — shock type, target, magnitude, unit, and propagation rule — so that a scenario states what it shocks and how, not only that it has a digest.";
